/* LinguaQuest - курс «Грамматика с нуля»: уроки, задания, ответы (сгенерировано) */
window.GRAMMAR_COURSE = {"lessons":[{"id":1,"lvl":"A1","t":"Формула английского предложения","body":"<p>В русском слова можно переставлять: «Я люблю футбол», «Футбол я люблю». В английском <b>порядок слов почти всегда один</b>. Поменяли местами - поменялся смысл или вышла ошибка.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\">КТО → ДЕЛАЕТ → ЧТО / КОГО → ГДЕ → КОГДА</div>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Кто</th><th>Делает</th><th>Что / кого</th><th>Где</th><th>Когда</th></tr>\n<tr><td>I</td><td>play</td><td>football</td><td>in the park</td><td>on Sundays.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>My dad</td><td>works</td><td>-</td><td>in a bank</td><td>every day.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>We</td><td>watched</td><td>a film</td><td>at home</td><td>yesterday.</td></tr></table>\n<ul><li><b>В предложении всегда есть «кто» и глагол.</b> «Холодно» = <i>It is cold.</i> «Идёт дождь» = <i>It is raining.</i> (здесь «кто» - пустое слово <b>it</b>).</li>\n<li><b>Глагол один раз и сразу после «кто».</b> Не «I football play», а <i>I play football.</i></li>\n<li><b>Место и время - в конце</b> (или время в самом начале: <i>Yesterday we watched a film.</i>).</li></ul>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ Football I like. → ✅ I like football. &nbsp; ❌ Is cold. → ✅ It is cold. &nbsp; ❌ I every day go to school. → ✅ I go to school every day.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"Расставьте слова: like / I / music","a":"I like music."},{"q":"Расставьте слова: in Moscow / live / we","a":"We live in Moscow."},{"q":"Расставьте слова: football / on Sundays / play / they","a":"They play football on Sundays."},{"q":"Переведите: Сегодня холодно.","a":"It is cold today."}]},{"id":2,"lvl":"A1","t":"Глагол to be: am / is / are","body":"<p><b>To be</b> = «быть, являться, находиться». Нужен, когда в русском <b>нет действия</b>: кто вы, какой, где.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Кто</th><th>Сейчас</th><th>Было</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td>I</td><td><b>am</b> (I'm)</td><td>was</td><td>I am a student. - Я студент.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>he, she, it</td><td><b>is</b> (he's)</td><td>was</td><td>She is tired. - Она устала.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>you, we, they</td><td><b>are</b> (we're)</td><td>were</td><td>We are at home. - Мы дома.</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Не:</b> I am <b>not</b> / she <b>isn't</b> / they <b>aren't</b>. &nbsp; <b>Вопрос:</b> переставляем: <i><b>Is</b> she tired? <b>Are</b> you at home?</i></p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ She is go to school. (есть действие go - to be не нужен) → ✅ She goes to school.<br>❌ I student. (нет глагола) → ✅ I am a student.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My sister ___ 12 years old.","a":"is"},{"q":"We ___ friends.","a":"are"},{"q":"I ___ not hungry.","a":"am"},{"q":"Сделайте вопрос: They are at school.","a":"Are they at school?"},{"q":"Переведите: Он был дома вчера.","a":"He was at home yesterday."}]},{"id":3,"lvl":"A1","t":"Present Simple: обычно, всегда, каждый день","body":"<p>Действие повторяется, привычка, факт: <i>every day, usually, often, always, never</i>.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>I, you, we, they</th><th>he, she, it (один человек, предмет)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>+</td><td>I <b>work</b>.</td><td>She <b>works</b>. (watch → watch<b>es</b>, go → go<b>es</b>, study → stud<b>ies</b>, have → <b>has</b>)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>−</td><td>I <b>don't</b> work.</td><td>She <b>doesn't</b> work. (без -s!)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>?</td><td><b>Do</b> you work?</td><td><b>Does</b> she work? (без -s!)</td></tr></table>\n<p>Слова <i>always, usually, often, sometimes, never</i> стоят <b>перед</b> глаголом: <i>I <b>usually</b> get up at 7.</i></p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ He work. → ✅ He works. &nbsp; ❌ She doesn't works. → ✅ She doesn't work. &nbsp; ❌ My parents works. → ✅ My parents work.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My brother ___ (play) football.","a":"plays"},{"q":"They ___ (not / like) fish.","a":"don't like"},{"q":"___ your mom ___ (work) in a bank?","a":"Does … work"},{"q":"Переведите: Я обычно встаю в 7.","a":"I usually get up at 7."}]},{"id":4,"lvl":"A1","t":"Вопросы и вопросительные слова","body":"<p>Русский вопрос - это интонация. Английский вопрос - это <b>порядок слов + помощник</b>.</p>\n<div class=\"formula\">ВОПРОСИТЕЛЬНОЕ СЛОВО → ПОМОЩНИК → КТО → ГЛАГОЛ → остальное?</div>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Вопрос. слово</th><th>Помощник</th><th>Кто</th><th>Глагол</th><th>Остальное</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Where</td><td>do</td><td>you</td><td>live?</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>What</td><td>does</td><td>she</td><td>like?</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>When</td><td>did</td><td>they</td><td>come</td><td>home?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Why</td><td>are</td><td>you</td><td>-</td><td>sad? (с to be помощник не нужен)</td></tr></table>\n<table class=\"t small\"><tr><td><b>Who</b> - кто</td><td><b>What</b> - что</td><td><b>Where</b> - где, куда</td><td><b>When</b> - когда</td><td><b>Why</b> - почему</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>How</b> - как</td><td><b>Which</b> - который (выбор)</td><td><b>Whose</b> - чей</td><td><b>How old</b> - сколько лет</td><td><b>What time</b> - во сколько</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>How many</b> - сколько (считаем: books)</td><td><b>How much</b> - сколько (не считаем: milk, money)</td><td><b>How often</b> - как часто</td><td><b>How long</b> - как долго</td><td><b>What kind of</b> - какой вид</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ Where you live? → ✅ Where do you live? &nbsp; ❌ What she likes? → ✅ What does she like?</div>","tasks":[{"q":"___ do you live? - In Moscow.","a":"Where"},{"q":"___ is your sister? - She is 12.","a":"How old"},{"q":"Сделайте вопрос: Где он работает?","a":"Where does he work?"},{"q":"Сделайте вопрос: Что ты делал вчера?","a":"What did you do yesterday?"}]},{"id":5,"lvl":"A1","t":"Артикли a / an / the","body":"<p>В русском артиклей нет, поэтому их часто забывают. Правило простое:</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Артикль</th><th>Когда</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>a</b> / <b>an</b></td><td>Один, какой-то, впервые упоминаем. <b>an</b> - перед гласным звуком.</td><td>I have <b>a</b> dog. She is <b>an</b> engineer. <b>an</b> apple, <b>an</b> hour</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>the</b></td><td>Тот самый, понятно какой, единственный в мире</td><td><b>The</b> dog is black. (та, о которой говорили) <b>the</b> sun, <b>the</b> world</td></tr>\n<tr><td>без артикля</td><td>Вообще, во множественном / неисчисляемом; имена, города, страны, языки, спорт, предметы, еда</td><td>I like <b>cats</b>. <b>Water</b> is important. I live in <b>Moscow</b>. I play <b>football</b>. I speak <b>English</b>.</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Устойчивые:</b> at home, at school, at work, go to bed, go home (без артикля); <b>the</b> cinema, <b>the</b> USA, <b>the</b> UK, play <b>the</b> guitar.</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I am student. → ✅ I am a student. &nbsp; ❌ I play the football. → ✅ I play football. &nbsp; ❌ a apple → ✅ an apple</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I have ___ brother.","a":"a"},{"q":"___ sun is hot.","a":"The"},{"q":"She eats ___ apple every day.","a":"an"},{"q":"I like ___ music. (артикль нужен?)","a":"без артикля"}]},{"id":6,"lvl":"A1","t":"Местоимения: I - me - my - mine","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Кто делает</th><th>Кого / кому</th><th>Чей (+ слово)</th><th>Чей (без слова)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>I - я</td><td>me - меня, мне</td><td>my - мой</td><td>mine</td></tr>\n<tr><td>you - ты, вы</td><td>you</td><td>your</td><td>yours</td></tr>\n<tr><td>he - он</td><td>him</td><td>his</td><td>his</td></tr>\n<tr><td>she - она</td><td>her</td><td>her</td><td>hers</td></tr>\n<tr><td>it - оно (предмет, животное)</td><td>it</td><td>its</td><td>-</td></tr>\n<tr><td>we - мы</td><td>us</td><td>our</td><td>ours</td></tr>\n<tr><td>they - они</td><td>them</td><td>their</td><td>theirs</td></tr></table>\n<p><i><b>I</b> love <b>her</b>. <b>She</b> loves <b>me</b>. This is <b>my</b> phone. The phone is <b>mine</b>.</i><br>\n<b>this / these</b> - этот / эти (рядом); <b>that / those</b> - тот / те (далеко).</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ Me like it. → ✅ I like it. &nbsp; ❌ Give I the pen. → ✅ Give me the pen. &nbsp; ❌ This is my. → ✅ This is mine.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"Help ___ (я), please!","a":"me"},{"q":"This is ___ (её) bag.","a":"her"},{"q":"I know ___ (их).","a":"them"},{"q":"These books are ___ (наши).","a":"ours"}]},{"id":7,"lvl":"A1","t":"Множественное число, some / any, much / many","body":"<p><b>Много штук:</b> + s: book → book<b>s</b>; -s, -sh, -ch, -x + es: box → box<b>es</b>; согласная + y → ies: city → cit<b>ies</b>.<br>\n<b>Особые:</b> man → <b>men</b>, woman → <b>women</b>, child → <b>children</b>, person → <b>people</b>, foot → <b>feet</b>, tooth → <b>teeth</b>, mouse → <b>mice</b>.</p>\n<p><b>Неисчисляемые</b> (нельзя посчитать, нет -s и нет a): water, milk, money, bread, music, information, advice, homework, news, furniture.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>Считаем (books)</th><th>Не считаем (water)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>много</td><td><b>many</b> books</td><td><b>much</b> water (в вопросах и с not)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>много (везде)</td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>a lot of</b> books / water</td></tr>\n<tr><td>немного</td><td><b>a few</b> books</td><td><b>a little</b> water</td></tr>\n<tr><td>сколько?</td><td><b>How many</b> books?</td><td><b>How much</b> water?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>некоторое / какое-нибудь</td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>some</b> - в «+»: I have some money. &nbsp; <b>any</b> - в «−» и «?»: I don't have any money. Do you have any questions?</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ two childs → ✅ two children &nbsp; ❌ a money / moneys → ✅ money &nbsp; ❌ many water → ✅ much / a lot of water</div>","tasks":[{"q":"three ___ (person)","a":"people"},{"q":"How ___ money do you have?","a":"much"},{"q":"I don't have ___ friends here. (some/any)","a":"any"},{"q":"There are a lot of ___ (child) in the park.","a":"children"}]},{"id":8,"lvl":"A1","t":"There is / there are: «есть, находится»","body":"<p>Когда говорим, что <b>где-то что-то есть</b>, английский начинает с <b>there is / there are</b>, а место - в конце.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>Одна вещь</th><th>Много вещей</th></tr>\n<tr><td>+</td><td><b>There is</b> a cat in the room.</td><td><b>There are</b> two cats in the room.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>−</td><td>There <b>isn't</b> a bank here.</td><td>There <b>aren't</b> any shops here.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>?</td><td><b>Is there</b> a bank near here?</td><td><b>Are there</b> any shops?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>было</td><td>There <b>was</b> a party.</td><td>There <b>were</b> many people.</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ In the room is a cat. → ✅ There is a cat in the room. &nbsp; ❌ Here is many shops. → ✅ There are many shops here.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"___ a supermarket near my house.","a":"There is"},{"q":"___ 25 students in my class.","a":"There are"},{"q":"Сделайте вопрос: Есть здесь аптека?","a":"Is there a pharmacy here?"},{"q":"Переведите: На столе две книги.","a":"There are two books on the table."}]},{"id":9,"lvl":"A1","t":"Have / have got: «у меня есть»","body":"<p>«У меня есть» в английском = «<b>я имею</b>»: <i>I <b>have</b> a sister.</i> (не «At me is a sister»).</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>I, you, we, they</th><th>he, she, it</th></tr>\n<tr><td>+</td><td>I <b>have</b> a car. / I<b>'ve got</b> a car.</td><td>She <b>has</b> a car. / She<b>'s got</b> a car.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>−</td><td>I <b>don't have</b> a car. / I <b>haven't got</b>.</td><td>She <b>doesn't have</b>. / She <b>hasn't got</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>?</td><td><b>Do</b> you <b>have</b> a car? / <b>Have</b> you <b>got</b>?</td><td><b>Does</b> she <b>have</b>? / <b>Has</b> she <b>got</b>?</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>have got</b> - больше британский. В американском почти всегда <b>have / do you have</b>.<br>\n<b>have</b> ещё значит действие: <i>have breakfast</i> (завтракать), <i>have a shower</i>, <i>have fun</i>.</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ She have a dog. → ✅ She has a dog. &nbsp; ❌ Do she have…? → ✅ Does she have…?</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My friend ___ a new phone.","a":"has"},{"q":"I ___ (не) have a laptop.","a":"don't"},{"q":"___ you have any brothers?","a":"Do"},{"q":"Переведите: У неё есть кошка.","a":"She has a cat."}]},{"id":10,"lvl":"A1","t":"Can: «могу, умею»","body":"<p><b>can</b> + глагол (без to, без -s) - уметь, мочь, можно.</p>\n<p><i>I <b>can</b> swim. She <b>can</b> speak English.</i> (не «She cans», не «can to swim»)<br>\n<b>−</b> <i>I <b>can't</b> (cannot) drive.</i> &nbsp; <b>?</b> <i><b>Can</b> you help me?</i> - Можете помочь?<br>\n<b>Было:</b> <i>I <b>could</b> swim when I was 5.</i> - Я умел плавать в 5 лет.<br>\n<b>Вежливо:</b> <i><b>Could</b> you help me?</i> - Не могли бы вы помочь?</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ She cans dance. → ✅ She can dance. &nbsp; ❌ I can to swim. → ✅ I can swim.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My dad ___ (умеет) cook.","a":"can"},{"q":"I ___ (не могу) come today.","a":"can't"},{"q":"___ I open the window? (можно)","a":"Can"},{"q":"Переведите: Ты умеешь водить машину?","a":"Can you drive?"}]},{"id":11,"lvl":"A1","t":"Present Continuous: «прямо сейчас»","body":"<div class=\"formula\">am / is / are + глагол-ing</div>\n<p><i>I <b>am reading</b> now. She <b>is sleeping</b>. They <b>are playing</b> football.</i><br>\n<b>−</b> I'm <b>not</b> working. &nbsp; <b>?</b> <b>Are</b> you listening? What <b>are</b> you <b>doing</b>?</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Present Simple</th><th>Present Continuous</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Обычно, всегда: <i>I <b>play</b> football on Sundays.</i></td><td>Сейчас, в этот момент: <i>I <b>am playing</b> football now.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td>usually, every day, often</td><td>now, at the moment, look!, today</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>-ing:</b> make → making (e убираем), swim → swimming, run → running, sit → sitting (удваиваем).<br>\nТакже - планы: <i>I'm meeting Tom tomorrow.</i> (договорились)</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I reading now. → ✅ I am reading now. &nbsp; ❌ I am play. → ✅ I am playing. &nbsp; ❌ I am knowing. → ✅ I know. (know, like, want, need - без -ing)</div>","tasks":[{"q":"Look! It ___ (rain).","a":"is raining"},{"q":"She usually ___ (walk) to school.","a":"walks"},{"q":"What ___ you ___ (do) now?","a":"are … doing"},{"q":"Переведите: Я сейчас не работаю.","a":"I'm not working now."}]},{"id":12,"lvl":"A1","t":"Past Simple: прошлое","body":"<p>Действие было и закончилось: <i>yesterday, last week, ago, in 2020</i>.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>Для всех (I, she, they…)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>+</td><td>Правильные + <b>ed</b>: work → work<b>ed</b>, play → play<b>ed</b>, study → stud<b>ied</b>. Неправильные - 2-я форма: go → <b>went</b>, see → <b>saw</b> (таблица в «Неправильные глаголы.pdf»)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>−</td><td>I <b>didn't</b> + 1-я форма: I <b>didn't go</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>?</td><td><b>Did</b> you + 1-я форма? <b>Did</b> you <b>go</b>?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>to be</td><td>I/he/she/it <b>was</b>, you/we/they <b>were</b>; wasn't / weren't; Was he…? Were you…?</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I didn't went. → ✅ I didn't go. &nbsp; ❌ Did you saw? → ✅ Did you see? &nbsp; ❌ I goed. → ✅ I went.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"Yesterday I ___ (buy) a phone.","a":"bought"},{"q":"We ___ (not / see) him.","a":"didn't see"},{"q":"___ you ___ (go) to school yesterday?","a":"Did … go"},{"q":"They ___ (be) at home last night.","a":"were"}]},{"id":13,"lvl":"A1","t":"Future Simple: will","body":"<div class=\"formula\">will + глагол (для всех)</div>\n<p><i>I <b>will</b> call you. She'<b>ll</b> help. It <b>will</b> rain tomorrow.</i><br>\n<b>−</b> <i>I <b>won't</b> (will not) be late.</i> &nbsp; <b>?</b> <i><b>Will</b> you come?</i></p>\n<p><b>Когда will:</b> решили прямо сейчас (<i>I'll take it!</i>), обещание (<i>I'll help you</i>), прогноз «думаю, будет» (<i>I think it will rain</i>), просьба (<i>Will you open the door?</i>).<br>\nЕсли план уже есть - <b>going to</b> (урок A2).</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I will to go. → ✅ I will go. &nbsp; ❌ She wills come. → ✅ She will come. &nbsp; ❌ If it will rain… → ✅ If it rains… (после if - настоящее)</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ (позвоню) you tomorrow.","a":"will call"},{"q":"She ___ (не будет) be late.","a":"won't"},{"q":"___ you help me?","a":"Will"},{"q":"Переведите: Я думаю, он победит.","a":"I think he will win."}]},{"id":14,"lvl":"A1","t":"Предлоги времени: at / in / on","body":"<p>Запомните пирамиду: <b>at</b> - точка, <b>on</b> - день, <b>in</b> - длинный период.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>AT - точное время</th><th>ON - день, дата</th><th>IN - месяц, год, сезон, часть дня</th></tr>\n<tr><td>at 6 o'clock, at 2 pm<br>at night, at noon<br>at lunchtime<br>at the weekend (брит.)</td><td>on Monday, on Friday<br>on May 9th, on January 1st<br>on my birthday<br>on Christmas Day<br>on the weekend (амер.)</td><td>in May, in December<br>in 2025<br>in winter, in summer<br>in the morning, in the afternoon, in the evening</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Без предлога:</b> <i>today, tomorrow, yesterday, tonight, <b>last</b> week, <b>next</b> year, <b>this</b> month, <b>every</b> day.</i> (не «in last week»)<br>\n<b>Сколько длится:</b> <i>for 2 hours</i> (в течение); <b>с какого момента:</b> <i>since 2020</i>; <b>через:</b> <i>in 5 minutes</i>; <b>назад:</b> <i>2 days ago</i>.</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ in Monday → ✅ on Monday &nbsp; ❌ at the morning → ✅ in the morning &nbsp; ❌ in next week → ✅ next week &nbsp; ❌ on night → ✅ at night</div>","tasks":[{"q":"___ Sunday","a":"on"},{"q":"___ 7 o'clock","a":"at"},{"q":"___ July","a":"in"},{"q":"___ the evening","a":"in"},{"q":"I'll see you ___ next week. (нужен предлог?)","a":"без предлога"}]},{"id":15,"lvl":"A1","t":"Предлоги места и направления","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>AT - точка, место-событие</th><th>IN - внутри</th><th>ON - на поверхности</th></tr>\n<tr><td>at home, at work, at school<br>at the bus stop, at the station<br>at the door, at the table<br>at the party, at the concert</td><td>in the room, in the box, in the bag<br>in the car, in a taxi<br>in the city, in Moscow, in Russia<br>in the photo, in the world</td><td>on the table, on the wall, on the floor<br>on the bus, on the train, on the plane<br>on the phone, on the internet, on TV<br>on the page, on the left / right</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Ещё:</b> under (под), next to (рядом с), between (между), behind (позади), in front of (перед), opposite (напротив), near (рядом), above (над).</p>\n<p><b>Куда:</b> <b>to</b> - go <b>to</b> school, come <b>to</b> Moscow. <b>Без to:</b> go <b>home</b>, go <b>there</b>, go <b>abroad</b>.<br>\n<b>Откуда:</b> <b>from</b> - I'm <b>from</b> Russia. &nbsp; <b>into</b> - внутрь: go <b>into</b> the room. &nbsp; <b>arrive in</b> (город, страна) / <b>arrive at</b> (здание).</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I go to home. → ✅ I go home. &nbsp; ❌ in the bus → ✅ on the bus &nbsp; ❌ I'm in home. → ✅ I'm at home. &nbsp; ❌ arrive to Moscow → ✅ arrive in Moscow</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My phone is ___ the table.","a":"on"},{"q":"She is ___ work now.","a":"at"},{"q":"I live ___ Moscow.","a":"in"},{"q":"We go ___ school by bus.","a":"to"},{"q":"I'm sitting ___ the bus.","a":"on"}]},{"id":16,"lvl":"A1","t":"Главные маленькие предлоги: with, for, about, of, by","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Предлог</th><th>Значение</th><th>Примеры</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>with</b></td><td>с (вместе, чем)</td><td>I live <b>with</b> my parents. Coffee <b>with</b> milk. Write <b>with</b> a pen.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>without</b></td><td>без</td><td>Tea <b>without</b> sugar.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>for</b></td><td>для; в течение</td><td>This is <b>for</b> you. I waited <b>for</b> an hour.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>about</b></td><td>о, про; около</td><td>Tell me <b>about</b> your family. <b>About</b> 10 people.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>of</b></td><td>родительный падеж («чего»)</td><td>a cup <b>of</b> tea, the name <b>of</b> the film, one <b>of</b> my friends</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>by</b></td><td>на (транспорте); кем</td><td><b>by</b> bus, <b>by</b> car, <b>by</b> plane (но <b>on</b> foot). A book <b>by</b> Tolstoy.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>to</b></td><td>к, в (куда); кому</td><td>Give it <b>to</b> me. Talk <b>to</b> her.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>from</b></td><td>из, от</td><td>A letter <b>from</b> my friend. <b>From</b> 9 <b>to</b> 5.</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I go by foot. → ✅ I go on foot. &nbsp; ❌ a cup tea → ✅ a cup of tea</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I go to school ___ bus.","a":"by"},{"q":"Tell me ___ your hobby.","a":"about"},{"q":"This present is ___ you.","a":"for"},{"q":"a glass ___ water","a":"of"}]},{"id":17,"lvl":"A1","t":"Глаголы, которые требуют предлог","body":"<p>Эти сочетания нужно учить целиком - по-русски предлог часто другой или его нет.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>listen to</b> music - слушать музыку</td><td><b>look at</b> me - смотри на меня</td><td><b>wait for</b> a bus - ждать автобус</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>look for</b> keys - искать ключи</td><td><b>look after</b> a child - присматривать</td><td><b>think about</b> it - думать об этом</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>talk to</b> / <b>about</b> - говорить с / о</td><td><b>ask for</b> help - просить помощь</td><td><b>pay for</b> food - платить за еду</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>agree with</b> you - согласен с тобой</td><td><b>depend on</b> - зависеть от</td><td><b>belong to</b> - принадлежать</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>be good at</b> maths - хорош в</td><td><b>be interested in</b> - интересоваться</td><td><b>be afraid of</b> - бояться</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>be married to</b> - женат на</td><td><b>be proud of</b> - гордиться</td><td><b>be angry with</b> someone - злиться на</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>А тут предлога нет:</b> <i>call me</i> (позвонить мне), <i>answer the question</i> (ответить на вопрос), <i>enter the room</i> (войти в комнату), <i>discuss the plan</i> (обсудить план).</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I listen music. → ✅ I listen to music. &nbsp; ❌ I'm waiting the bus. → ✅ I'm waiting for the bus. &nbsp; ❌ I'm interested of… → ✅ I'm interested in…</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I'm listening ___ a podcast.","a":"to"},{"q":"Look ___ this photo!","a":"at"},{"q":"She's good ___ maths.","a":"at"},{"q":"We're waiting ___ you.","a":"for"},{"q":"I'm interested ___ economics.","a":"in"}]},{"id":18,"lvl":"A1","t":"Союзы: как соединять мысли","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Союз</th><th>Значение</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>and</b></td><td>и</td><td>I like tea <b>and</b> coffee.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>but</b></td><td>но</td><td>It's cold, <b>but</b> sunny.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>or</b></td><td>или</td><td>Tea <b>or</b> coffee?</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>so</b></td><td>поэтому, так что</td><td>I was tired, <b>so</b> I went to bed.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>because</b></td><td>потому что</td><td>I stayed home <b>because</b> I was ill.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>when</b></td><td>когда</td><td><b>When</b> I was a child, I lived in a village.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>if</b></td><td>если</td><td><b>If</b> it rains, I'll stay home.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>before / after</b></td><td>до / после того как</td><td>Wash your hands <b>before</b> you eat.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>until</b></td><td>пока не, до</td><td>Wait <b>until</b> I come.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>while</b></td><td>пока, в то время как</td><td>I listen to music <b>while</b> I cook.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>that</b></td><td>что (после think, know, say)</td><td>I think <b>that</b> he is right. (that можно опустить)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>although</b></td><td>хотя</td><td><b>Although</b> it was late, we went out.</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Важно:</b> после <b>when, if, before, after, until</b> о будущем говорим в <b>настоящем</b>: <i>I'll call you <b>when</b> I <b>come</b> home.</i> (не «will come»)</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I like tea and I like also coffee. → ✅ I like tea and coffee too. &nbsp; ❌ When I will come… → ✅ When I come…</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I was hungry, ___ I ate a sandwich.","a":"so"},{"q":"I like football ___ I don't like basketball.","a":"but"},{"q":"She's happy ___ she passed the test.","a":"because"},{"q":"I'll call you when I ___ (get) home.","a":"get"}]},{"id":19,"lvl":"A2","t":"Be going to: планы и очевидное будущее","body":"<div class=\"formula\">am / is / are + going to + глагол</div>\n<p><i>I'<b>m going to</b> study economics. - Я собираюсь изучать экономику.</i> (план уже есть)<br>\n<i>Look at the clouds! It'<b>s going to</b> rain.</i> (видно по признакам)</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>will</th><th>going to</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Решил прямо сейчас: <i>The phone is ringing. - I'<b>ll</b> answer it.</i></td><td>Решил заранее: <i>I'<b>m going to</b> visit my grandma on Sunday.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Мнение, «думаю»: <i>I think he <b>will</b> win.</i></td><td>Вижу признаки: <i>He'<b>s going to</b> fall!</i></td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I going to study. → ✅ I'm going to study. &nbsp; ❌ I'm going to studying. → ✅ I'm going to study.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"We ___ (собираемся) buy a car.","a":"are going to"},{"q":"She ___ (не собирается) go to the party.","a":"isn't going to"},{"q":"What ___ you going to do?","a":"are"},{"q":"Переведите: Я собираюсь поступать в Columbia.","a":"I'm going to apply to Columbia."}]},{"id":20,"lvl":"A2","t":"Present Perfect: «уже сделал», опыт","body":"<div class=\"formula\">have / has + 3-я форма глагола</div>\n<p>Важен <b>результат сейчас</b> или <b>опыт в жизни</b>, а не когда именно.<br>\n<i>I <b>have lost</b> my keys. - Я потерял ключи (и сейчас их нет).</i><br>\n<i>She <b>has been</b> to London. - Она бывала в Лондоне.</i><br>\n<i><b>Have</b> you ever <b>seen</b> snow? - Ты когда-нибудь видел снег?</i></p>\n<p><b>Слова-подсказки:</b> ever (когда-нибудь), never (никогда), already (уже), yet (ещё, уже - в «−» и «?»), just (только что), recently, so far, for (в течение), since (с).<br>\n<i>I <b>have lived</b> here <b>for</b> 5 years / <b>since</b> 2021.</i> - Я живу здесь 5 лет (и сейчас живу).</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I have seen him yesterday. (есть время yesterday → Past Simple) → ✅ I saw him yesterday.<br>❌ I live here for 5 years. → ✅ I have lived here for 5 years.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ (finish) my homework already.","a":"have finished"},{"q":"She ___ never ___ (be) to the USA.","a":"has … been"},{"q":"___ you ever ___ (eat) sushi?","a":"Have … eaten"},{"q":"We ___ (know) each other since 2020.","a":"have known"}]},{"id":21,"lvl":"A2","t":"Past Continuous: «делал в тот момент»","body":"<div class=\"formula\">was / were + глагол-ing</div>\n<p><i>At 8 pm yesterday I <b>was watching</b> TV.</i> - Вчера в 8 вечера я смотрел ТВ (процесс).<br>\n<b>Длинное действие прервали коротким:</b> <i>I <b>was sleeping</b> when the phone <b>rang</b>.</i><br>\n<b>Два процесса одновременно:</b> <i><b>While</b> I was cooking, she was reading.</i></p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I was watch TV. → ✅ I was watching TV. &nbsp; ❌ When the phone was ringing, I slept. → ✅ When the phone rang, I was sleeping.</div>","tasks":[{"q":"At 9 pm we ___ (have) dinner.","a":"were having"},{"q":"I ___ (walk) home when it started to rain.","a":"was walking"},{"q":"What ___ you ___ (do) at 6 yesterday?","a":"were … doing"}]},{"id":22,"lvl":"A2","t":"Сравнение: больше, лучше, самый","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Слово</th><th>Сравнительная (более)</th><th>Превосходная (самый)</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Короткое: tall, cheap</td><td>tall<b>er</b> <b>than</b>, cheap<b>er</b></td><td><b>the</b> tall<b>est</b>, <b>the</b> cheap<b>est</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>на -y: happy, easy</td><td>happ<b>ier</b>, eas<b>ier</b></td><td><b>the</b> happ<b>iest</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Длинное: expensive, interesting</td><td><b>more</b> expensive</td><td><b>the most</b> expensive</td></tr>\n<tr><td>good / bad</td><td><b>better</b> / <b>worse</b></td><td><b>the best</b> / <b>the worst</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>many, much / little / far</td><td><b>more</b> / <b>less</b> / <b>further</b></td><td><b>the most</b> / <b>the least</b> / <b>the furthest</b></td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Такой же как:</b> <i>as tall <b>as</b> me</i>; <b>не такой как:</b> <i>not as expensive <b>as</b></i>.</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ more better → ✅ better &nbsp; ❌ He is taller then me. → ✅ He is taller than me. &nbsp; ❌ the most big → ✅ the biggest</div>","tasks":[{"q":"My brother is ___ (old) than me.","a":"older"},{"q":"This is ___ (good) film of the year.","a":"the best"},{"q":"English is ___ (easy) than Chinese.","a":"easier"},{"q":"This phone is ___ (expensive) in the shop.","a":"the most expensive"}]},{"id":23,"lvl":"A2","t":"Модальные: must, have to, should, may, might","body":"<p>После них глагол <b>без to</b> (кроме have to) и <b>без -s</b>.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Слово</th><th>Значение</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>must</b></td><td>должен (сам считаю, правило)</td><td>I <b>must</b> study more. You <b>must</b> wear a seat belt.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>mustn't</b></td><td>нельзя</td><td>You <b>mustn't</b> smoke here.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>have to</b></td><td>приходится (обстоятельства)</td><td>I <b>have to</b> get up at 6. She <b>has to</b> work.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>don't have to</b></td><td>не обязательно</td><td>You <b>don't have to</b> come. (можешь не приходить)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>should</b></td><td>стоит, следует (совет)</td><td>You <b>should</b> see a doctor.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>may / might</b></td><td>может быть, возможно</td><td>It <b>might</b> rain. I <b>may</b> be late.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>may / can</b></td><td>можно (разрешение)</td><td><b>May</b> I come in?</td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ You must to go. → ✅ You must go. &nbsp; ❌ She shoulds… → ✅ She should… &nbsp; mustn't (нельзя) ≠ don't have to (не обязательно)</div>","tasks":[{"q":"You ___ see a doctor. (совет)","a":"should"},{"q":"I ___ (приходится) work on Saturdays.","a":"have to"},{"q":"You ___ (нельзя) use phones in the exam.","a":"mustn't"},{"q":"It ___ (возможно) snow tomorrow.","a":"might"}]},{"id":24,"lvl":"B1","t":"Все времена на одной странице","body":"<p>Время = <b>когда</b> (настоящее / прошлое / будущее) + <b>какое</b> (простое / процесс / результат / процесс до момента).</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th></th><th>Simple - факт, обычно</th><th>Continuous - процесс</th><th>Perfect - результат к моменту</th><th>Perfect Continuous - процесс до момента</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Present</b></td><td>I <b>work</b> / she work<b>s</b></td><td>I <b>am working</b></td><td>I <b>have worked</b></td><td>I <b>have been working</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Past</b></td><td>I <b>worked</b> / went</td><td>I <b>was working</b></td><td>I <b>had worked</b></td><td>I <b>had been working</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Future</b></td><td>I <b>will work</b></td><td>I <b>will be working</b></td><td>I <b>will have worked</b></td><td>I <b>will have been working</b></td></tr></table>\n<ul><li><b>Present Perfect Continuous:</b> <i>I've been studying for 3 hours.</i> - Я учусь уже 3 часа (и всё ещё).</li>\n<li><b>Past Perfect:</b> <i>When I arrived, the film <b>had</b> already <b>started</b>.</i> - одно прошлое раньше другого.</li>\n<li><b>Future Continuous:</b> <i>At 10 tomorrow I'<b>ll be flying</b> to Paris.</i> - буду в процессе.</li>\n<li><b>Future Perfect:</b> <i>By 2028 I <b>will have finished</b> school.</i> - к моменту закончу.</li></ul>","tasks":[{"q":"When we arrived, the train ___ (already / leave).","a":"had already left"},{"q":"I ___ (wait) for you for an hour! (и всё ещё жду)","a":"have been waiting"},{"q":"This time tomorrow I ___ (lie) on the beach.","a":"will be lying"},{"q":"By June I ___ (learn) 1000 words.","a":"will have learned"}]},{"id":25,"lvl":"B1","t":"Present Perfect или Past Simple?","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Past Simple</th><th>Present Perfect</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Есть <b>когда</b> (yesterday, in 2020, ago, last…) или история закончена</td><td><b>Когда - неважно</b>, важен результат / опыт; период ещё идёт</td></tr>\n<tr><td><i>I <b>lost</b> my keys yesterday.</i></td><td><i>I <b>have lost</b> my keys.</i> (сейчас их нет)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><i>I <b>visited</b> Paris in 2019.</i></td><td><i>I <b>have visited</b> Paris twice.</i> (опыт)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><i>When <b>did</b> you <b>arrive</b>?</i></td><td><i><b>Have</b> you ever <b>been</b> abroad?</i></td></tr></table>\n<p>Вопрос со словом <b>When</b> → всегда Past Simple.</p>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ (see) this film last week.","a":"saw"},{"q":"I ___ (never / see) this film.","a":"have never seen"},{"q":"She ___ (live) in London since 2019.","a":"has lived"},{"q":"When ___ you ___ (start) learning English?","a":"did … start"}]},{"id":26,"lvl":"B1","t":"Used to / would: привычки в прошлом","body":"<p><b>used to</b> + глагол = «раньше (обычно) делал, а теперь нет».<br>\n<i>I <b>used to</b> play computer games every day.</i> - Раньше я каждый день играл.<br>\n<b>−</b> <i>I <b>didn't use to</b> like vegetables.</i> &nbsp; <b>?</b> <i><b>Did</b> you <b>use to</b> live here?</i></p>\n<p><b>would</b> - тоже повторяющиеся действия в прошлом (в рассказах): <i>Every summer we <b>would</b> go to the sea.</i> Но не для состояний: <i>I <b>used to</b> have long hair.</i> (не would have)</p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ I use to play. (о прошлом) → ✅ I used to play. &nbsp; Не путать: <b>be used to</b> = привык: <i>I'm used to getting up early.</i></div>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ (раньше) live in a village.","a":"used to"},{"q":"She ___ (раньше не) like coffee.","a":"didn't use to"},{"q":"___ you use to play football?","a":"Did"}]},{"id":27,"lvl":"B1","t":"Условные предложения: 0, 1, 2, 3","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Тип</th><th>Когда</th><th>If-часть</th><th>Результат</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>0</b></td><td>всегда так (факт)</td><td>Present</td><td>Present</td><td>If you heat ice, it <b>melts</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>1</b></td><td>реально в будущем</td><td>Present</td><td><b>will</b> + глагол</td><td>If it <b>rains</b>, I <b>will stay</b> home.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>2</b></td><td>нереально / маловероятно сейчас</td><td>Past</td><td><b>would</b> + глагол</td><td>If I <b>had</b> money, I <b>would buy</b> a car. (но денег нет)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>3</b></td><td>о прошлом, уже не изменить</td><td>Past Perfect</td><td><b>would have</b> + 3-я ф.</td><td>If I <b>had studied</b>, I <b>would have passed</b>. (но не учил)</td></tr></table>\n<p>Во 2-м типе: <i>If I <b>were</b> you, I would… - На твоём месте я бы…</i></p>\n<div class=\"err\">❌ If it will rain… → ✅ If it rains… &nbsp; ❌ If I would have money… → ✅ If I had money…</div>","tasks":[{"q":"If you ___ (study), you will pass.","a":"study"},{"q":"If I ___ (be) rich, I would travel the world.","a":"were"},{"q":"If she had left earlier, she ___ (not / miss) the bus.","a":"wouldn't have missed"},{"q":"If I ___ you, I'd apply to UPenn.","a":"were"}]},{"id":28,"lvl":"B1","t":"Пассивный залог: «сделано кем-то»","body":"<div class=\"formula\">be (в нужном времени) + 3-я форма</div>\n<p>Важно не <b>кто</b> сделал, а <b>что</b> сделано.<br>\n<i>They <b>make</b> iPhones in China.</i> → <i>iPhones <b>are made</b> in China.</i></p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><td>Present</td><td>English <b>is spoken</b> here.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Past</td><td>The house <b>was built</b> in 1990.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Present Perfect</td><td>My bike <b>has been stolen</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Future</td><td>The results <b>will be announced</b> tomorrow.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>с модальным</td><td>It <b>must be done</b> today.</td></tr></table>\n<p>Кем: <b>by</b> - <i>The book was written <b>by</b> Tolstoy.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"Coffee ___ (grow) in Brazil.","a":"is grown"},{"q":"This bridge ___ (build) in 1950.","a":"was built"},{"q":"My phone ___ (steal)! (только что)","a":"has been stolen"},{"q":"The letter will ___ (send) tomorrow.","a":"be sent"}]},{"id":29,"lvl":"B1","t":"Косвенная речь и косвенные вопросы","body":"<p>Пересказываем чужие слова: время «сдвигается на шаг назад».</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Прямая речь</th><th>Косвенная</th></tr>\n<tr><td>\"I <b>am</b> tired.\"</td><td>He said (that) he <b>was</b> tired.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>\"I <b>like</b> it.\"</td><td>She said she <b>liked</b> it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>\"I <b>will</b> call.\"</td><td>He said he <b>would</b> call.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>\"I <b>saw</b> him.\"</td><td>She said she <b>had seen</b> him.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>\"<b>Can</b> you help?\"</td><td>He asked <b>if</b> I <b>could</b> help.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>\"Where <b>do you live</b>?\"</td><td>She asked where <b>I lived</b>. (порядок как в утверждении!)</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>say</b> (без «кому»): <i>He said that…</i> &nbsp; <b>tell</b> + кому: <i>He told <b>me</b> that…</i><br>\n<b>Косвенный вопрос (вежливо):</b> <i>Do you know <b>where the station is</b>?</i> (не «where is the station»)</p>","tasks":[{"q":"\"I'm hungry.\" → He said he ___ hungry.","a":"was"},{"q":"\"I will help you.\" → She said she ___ help me.","a":"would"},{"q":"Вежливо: Where is the bank? → Could you tell me where ___?","a":"the bank is"}]},{"id":30,"lvl":"B1","t":"Придаточные: who, which, that, whose, where","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>who</b> - о людях</td><td><i>The man <b>who</b> lives next door is a doctor.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>which</b> - о вещах</td><td><i>The phone <b>which</b> I bought is great.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>that</b> - люди и вещи (разговорное)</td><td><i>The film <b>that</b> we watched was boring.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>whose</b> - чей</td><td><i>The girl <b>whose</b> dad is a pilot.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>where</b> - где</td><td><i>The city <b>where</b> I was born.</i></td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Уточняющее</b> (defining, без запятых) - без него непонятно, о ком речь: <i>The students <b>who</b> passed got a prize.</i><br>\n<b>Дополнительное</b> (non-defining, с запятыми, без that) - просто доп. информация: <i>My brother, <b>who</b> lives in Kazan, is a doctor.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"The woman ___ helped me was very kind.","a":"who"},{"q":"This is the house ___ I grew up.","a":"where"},{"q":"I have a friend ___ mother is a teacher.","a":"whose"},{"q":"The book ___ you gave me is great.","a":"which / that"}]},{"id":31,"lvl":"B1","t":"Модальные возможности: must be, might be, can't be","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Уверенность</th><th>Сейчас</th><th>О прошлом</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Точно да (≈ 95%)</td><td>He <b>must be</b> tired.</td><td>He <b>must have been</b> tired.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Может быть (≈ 50%)</td><td>She <b>might / may / could be</b> at home.</td><td>She <b>might have forgotten</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Точно нет (≈ 95%)</td><td>It <b>can't be</b> true.</td><td>He <b>can't have done</b> it.</td></tr></table>\n<p>«Стоило / надо было»: <i>You <b>should have</b> studied.</i> - Тебе надо было учиться (а ты не учил).</p>","tasks":[{"q":"He has worked 12 hours. He ___ be tired. (точно)","a":"must"},{"q":"She isn't answering. She ___ be asleep. (возможно)","a":"might / may"},{"q":"That ___ be Tom - he's in London. (точно нет)","a":"can't"}]},{"id":32,"lvl":"B1","t":"Gerund (-ing) или infinitive (to + глагол)","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>+ -ing</th><th>+ to + глагол</th></tr>\n<tr><td>enjoy, like/love/hate, finish, stop, avoid, mind, suggest, keep, practise, spend time<br><i>I enjoy <b>reading</b>. Stop <b>talking</b>!</i></td><td>want, need, decide, plan, hope, learn, try, agree, promise, would like<br><i>I want <b>to study</b>. I decided <b>to go</b>.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td>После <b>предлогов</b> всегда -ing:<br><i>I'm good at <b>drawing</b>. Thank you for <b>helping</b>. Before <b>leaving</b>…</i></td><td>После прилагательных: <i>It's easy <b>to learn</b>. Nice <b>to meet</b> you.</i></td></tr></table>\n<p>После <b>can, must, should, will, let, make</b> - без to: <i>Let me <b>help</b>.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"I enjoy ___ (swim).","a":"swimming"},{"q":"I want ___ (study) abroad.","a":"to study"},{"q":"She's interested in ___ (learn) Chinese.","a":"learning"},{"q":"We decided ___ (stay) home.","a":"to stay"}]},{"id":33,"lvl":"B1","t":"Разделительные вопросы: …, isn't it?","body":"<p>Хвостик «не так ли?»: утверждение <b>+</b> → хвостик <b>−</b>, и наоборот. Помощник берём из предложения.</p>\n<p><i>It's cold, <b>isn't it</b>? &nbsp; You like pizza, <b>don't you</b>? &nbsp; She can swim, <b>can't she</b>? &nbsp; They didn't come, <b>did they</b>? &nbsp; I'm right, <b>aren't I</b>?</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"You're a student, ___?","a":"aren't you"},{"q":"She lives here, ___?","a":"doesn't she"},{"q":"They didn't call, ___?","a":"did they"}]},{"id":34,"lvl":"B1","t":"Количество: each, every, both, either, neither, all, none","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>every</b> / <b>each</b> + ед. ч.</td><td><i><b>Every</b> student has a book. <b>Each</b> of them got a prize.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>both</b> - оба</td><td><i><b>Both</b> my parents work.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>either</b> - любой из двух / тоже (в «−»)</td><td><i>You can take <b>either</b> bus. I don't like it <b>either</b>.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>neither</b> - ни один из двух</td><td><i><b>Neither</b> answer is correct.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>all</b> / <b>none</b></td><td><i><b>All</b> (of) my friends came. <b>None of</b> them called.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>a few</b> / <b>few</b>; <b>a little</b> / <b>little</b></td><td><i>a few = несколько (хорошо); few = мало (плохо): <b>Few</b> people came.</i></td></tr></table>","tasks":[{"q":"___ my brothers are tall. (оба)","a":"Both"},{"q":"I don't like coffee, and I don't like tea ___.","a":"either"},{"q":"___ student needs a passport. (каждый)","a":"Every / Each"}]},{"id":35,"lvl":"B1","t":"Связки для мнения и эссе","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Зачем</th><th>Слова</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Добавить</td><td>also, moreover, in addition, furthermore, what's more</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Противопоставить</td><td>but, however, although, though, even though, despite / in spite of (+ сущ. или -ing), on the other hand, whereas</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Причина</td><td>because, because of (+ сущ.), since, as, due to</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Следствие</td><td>so, therefore, as a result, that's why</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Пример</td><td>for example, for instance, such as, like</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Мнение</td><td>I think, in my opinion, I believe, personally, as far as I know</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Итог</td><td>in conclusion, to sum up, overall, all in all</td></tr></table>\n<p><i><b>Although</b> it was raining, we went out. = <b>Despite</b> the rain, we went out.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"___ the rain, we played football. (несмотря на)","a":"Despite / In spite of"},{"q":"I was ill. ___, I stayed at home. (поэтому)","a":"Therefore / As a result"},{"q":"Cars are useful. ___, they pollute the air. (однако)","a":"However"}]},{"id":36,"lvl":"B1","t":"Фразовые глаголы","body":"<p>Глагол + маленькое слово = новый смысл. Учите целиком, с примером.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>take off</b> - снять; взлететь</td><td><b>take up</b> - начать (хобби)</td><td><b>take out</b> - вынуть, вывести</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>get up</b> - вставать</td><td><b>get out</b> - выйти, убраться</td><td><b>get over</b> - оправиться</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>give up</b> - бросить, сдаться</td><td><b>give in</b> - уступить</td><td><b>give out</b> - раздавать</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>find out</b> - узнать</td><td><b>look for</b> - искать</td><td><b>look after</b> - заботиться</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>turn on / off</b> - включить / выключить</td><td><b>put on</b> - надеть</td><td><b>come back</b> - вернуться</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>set up</b> - основать, настроить</td><td><b>carry out</b> - проводить, выполнять</td><td><b>figure out</b> - разобраться</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>run out of</b> - закончиться</td><td><b>put off</b> - откладывать</td><td><b>work out</b> - тренироваться; получиться</td></tr></table>\n<p><i>I <b>gave up</b> smoking. I want to <b>set up</b> my own business. Turn it <b>off</b>!</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ (встаю) at 7.","a":"get up"},{"q":"Don't ___ (сдавайся)!","a":"give up"},{"q":"Can you ___ (выключить) the light?","a":"turn off"},{"q":"I want to ___ (основать) a company.","a":"set up"}]},{"id":37,"lvl":"B1","t":"Словообразование: приставки и суффиксы","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Приставка</th><th>Смысл</th><th>Примеры</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>un- / in- / im- / dis-</b></td><td>не-, противоположное</td><td>happy → <b>un</b>happy, possible → <b>im</b>possible, agree → <b>dis</b>agree, honest → <b>dis</b>honest</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>re-</b></td><td>снова, пере-</td><td><b>re</b>write, <b>re</b>make, <b>re</b>consider</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>mis-</b></td><td>неправильно</td><td><b>mis</b>understand, <b>mis</b>take</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>over- / under-</b></td><td>слишком / недо-</td><td><b>over</b>sleep, <b>under</b>estimate</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>out-</b></td><td>превзойти</td><td><b>out</b>run (обогнать), <b>out</b>grow (перерасти)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>de-</b></td><td>отменить, убрать</td><td><b>de</b>activate, <b>de</b>motivate</td></tr></table>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Суффикс</th><th>Что делает</th><th>Примеры</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>-er / -or / -ist</b></td><td>человек</td><td>teach<b>er</b>, act<b>or</b>, econom<b>ist</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>-tion / -ment / -ness / -ity</b></td><td>существительное</td><td>educa<b>tion</b>, develop<b>ment</b>, happi<b>ness</b>, possibil<b>ity</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>-ful / -less</b></td><td>с / без</td><td>use<b>ful</b>, use<b>less</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>-able / -ible</b></td><td>можно</td><td>read<b>able</b>, poss<b>ible</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>-ly</b></td><td>наречие «как?»</td><td>quick → quick<b>ly</b>, careful → careful<b>ly</b></td></tr></table>","tasks":[{"q":"Противоположное к possible:","a":"impossible"},{"q":"Человек, который учит:","a":"teacher"},{"q":"Существительное от develop:","a":"development"},{"q":"Как? (quick):","a":"quickly"}]},{"id":38,"lvl":"B1","t":"Say, tell, speak, talk; do, make, take, get","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>say</b> - сказать слова (без «кому»): <i>say hello, say no, say sorry. He said that…</i></td><td><b>tell</b> - сказать кому / рассказать: <i>tell me, tell a story, tell the truth, tell a lie, tell a secret, tell a joke</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>speak</b> - говорить, язык, официально: <i>speak English, speak slowly, speak at a meeting</i></td><td><b>talk</b> - беседовать: <i>talk to someone, talk about something, talk on the phone</i></td></tr></table>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>do</b> - работа, задания: <i>do homework, do the dishes, do the laundry, do business, do sport, do your best</i></td><td><b>make</b> - создать результат: <i>make a cake, make a decision, make money, make a mistake, make friends, make a plan, make a phone call, make a promise</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>take</b> - <i>take a shower, take a nap, take a photo, take a taxi, take notes, take a break, take a risk</i></td><td><b>get</b> - получить / стать: <i>get cold, get tired, get married, get a job, get home, get better</i></td></tr></table>\n<p class=\"note\">В картинке из TikTok часть слов стояла не в своих колонках («do a business», «take a note» под DO). Правильно так, как в таблице выше.</p>","tasks":[{"q":"Can you ___ me the truth?","a":"tell"},{"q":"I ___ a mistake.","a":"made"},{"q":"She ___ English very well.","a":"speaks"},{"q":"I need to ___ my homework.","a":"do"}]},{"id":39,"lvl":"B2","t":"Смешанные условия, wish / if only","body":"<p><b>Mixed conditional</b> - прошлое влияет на настоящее: <i>If I <b>had studied</b> harder, I <b>would be</b> at Harvard now.</i> - Если бы я учился лучше (тогда), был бы сейчас в Гарварде.</p>\n<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Жалею о…</th><th>Форма</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td>настоящем</td><td>wish + Past</td><td>I <b>wish</b> I <b>had</b> more time. - Жаль, что у меня мало времени.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>прошлом</td><td>wish + Past Perfect</td><td>I <b>wish</b> I <b>had studied</b> more. - Жаль, что я мало учился.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>чужом поведении</td><td>wish + would</td><td>I <b>wish</b> you <b>would</b> stop talking.</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>If only</b> - то же, но сильнее: <i>If only I knew!</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"I wish I ___ (know) the answer. (сейчас)","a":"knew"},{"q":"If I had taken the job, I ___ (be) rich now.","a":"would be"}]},{"id":40,"lvl":"B2","t":"Perfect modals: should have, could have, might have","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><td><b>should have</b> + 3-я ф.</td><td>надо было (но не сделал)</td><td><i>You <b>should have told</b> me.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>shouldn't have</b></td><td>не надо было</td><td><i>I <b>shouldn't have eaten</b> so much.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>could have</b></td><td>мог бы (но не сделал)</td><td><i>You <b>could have called</b>!</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>might / may have</b></td><td>возможно, сделал</td><td><i>She <b>might have missed</b> the bus.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>must have</b> / <b>can't have</b></td><td>точно сделал / точно не сделал</td><td><i>He <b>must have forgotten</b>. She <b>can't have seen</b> it.</i></td></tr></table>","tasks":[{"q":"I failed. I ___ (надо было) studied more.","a":"should have"},{"q":"He isn't here. He ___ (наверное) missed the train.","a":"might have / must have"}]},{"id":41,"lvl":"B2","t":"Causative: have / get something done","body":"<p>Сделать что-то <b>не самому</b>, а руками другого: <i>I <b>had my hair cut</b>. - Я подстригся (в парикмахерской).</i><br>\n<i>I'm going to <b>get my phone repaired</b>. - Я отдам телефон в ремонт.</i><br>\nФормула: <b>have / get + предмет + 3-я форма</b>.</p>","tasks":[{"q":"I ___ my car ___ (repair) yesterday.","a":"had … repaired"}]},{"id":42,"lvl":"B2","t":"Продвинутый пассив и отчёты","body":"<p><i><b>It is said that</b> he is rich. = He <b>is said to be</b> rich.</i> - Говорят, он богат.<br>\n<i><b>It is believed that</b>… / <b>It is expected that</b>… / He <b>is thought to have left</b>.</i><br>\nПассив с -ing и to: <i>I hate <b>being told</b> what to do. She wants <b>to be invited</b>.</i></p>\n<p>Косвенная речь, глаголы-пересказчики: <i>He <b>advised</b> me to study. She <b>refused</b> to help. They <b>suggested</b> going. He <b>admitted</b> stealing it. She <b>promised</b> to call.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"People say he is a genius. → He is said ___ a genius.","a":"to be"}]},{"id":43,"lvl":"B2","t":"Инверсия (основы) и придаточные-причастия","body":"<p><b>Инверсия</b> - для силы и в официальной речи, после «отрицательных» слов порядок как в вопросе:<br>\n<i><b>Never have I seen</b> such a thing. - Никогда я такого не видел.<br><b>Not only did he</b> win, but he also broke the record.<br><b>Hardly had I arrived</b> when it started to rain.</i></p>\n<p><b>Participle clauses</b> - короче вместо целого придаточного:<br>\n<i><b>Feeling</b> tired, I went to bed. (= Because I felt tired…)<br><b>Having finished</b> work, she went home. (= After she had finished…)<br>The man <b>sitting</b> there is my boss. (= who is sitting)<br>The car <b>made</b> in Germany is expensive. (= which was made)</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"I have never seen such a beautiful city. → Never ___ such a beautiful city.","a":"have I seen"}]},{"id":44,"lvl":"B2","t":"Subjunctive и продвинутые артикли","body":"<p><b>Subjunctive</b> - после «требую, предлагаю, важно» глагол без изменений: <i>I suggest that he <b>study</b> more. It's important that she <b>be</b> on time.</i> (особенно в американском)<br>\nТакже: <i>If I <b>were</b> you… It's time we <b>went</b>. I'd rather you <b>stayed</b>.</i></p>\n<p><b>Артикли, тонкие случаи:</b> <i><b>the</b> rich (богатые люди), <b>the</b> 1990s, <b>the</b> Atlantic, <b>the</b> Alps, <b>the</b> Netherlands;</i> без артикля: <i>Lake Baikal, Mount Everest, by email, in hospital (брит.), go to prison</i>; «a» с профессией: <i>She is <b>an</b> economist.</i></p>","tasks":[{"q":"I recommend that he ___ (see) a doctor.","a":"see"}]},{"id":45,"lvl":"C1","t":"C1-C2: акценты, сокращения, академический стиль","body":"<table class=\"t\"><tr><th>Тема</th><th>Что это</th><th>Пример</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Cleft sentences</b></td><td>выделить главное</td><td><i><b>What I need is</b> time. <b>It was</b> Tom <b>who</b> called.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Emphasis</b></td><td>усилить</td><td><i>I <b>do</b> like it! She <b>did</b> call. The <b>very</b> first time.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Ellipsis</b></td><td>опустить повтор</td><td><i>- Are you coming? - I'd like to. (= to come)</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Nominalisation</b></td><td>глагол → существительное (научный стиль)</td><td><i>Prices increased → <b>The increase in prices</b>…</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Hedging</b></td><td>осторожно, без 100%</td><td><i>It <b>seems that</b>… This <b>may suggest</b>… <b>To some extent</b>… <b>It could be argued that</b>…</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Advanced linking</b></td><td>сложные связки</td><td><i>Notwithstanding…, Given that…, Insofar as…, Consequently…, Whereas…</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Advanced inversion</b></td><td>книжный стиль</td><td><i><b>Should you need</b> help, call me. <b>Had I known</b>, I would have come.</i></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Complex relative clauses</b></td><td>предлог + which / whom</td><td><i>The person <b>to whom</b> I spoke… The extent <b>to which</b>…</i></td></tr></table>\n<p>На уровне C2 новых правил почти нет: нужно уверенно владеть всем этим, понимать оттенки, юмор, сарказм и подтекст.</p>","tasks":[]}],"levels":[{"l":"A1","name":"База","g":"to be, have got, Present Simple / Continuous, can, there is/are, Past Simple, will","v":"семья, дом, школа, еда, одежда, хобби, время, погода, город","s":"представиться, рассказать о семье, дне, хобби и планах","li":"короткие диалоги, видео с субтитрами","r":"адаптированные тексты A1","w":"короткие предложения, сообщения, простые описания"},{"l":"A2","name":"Расширяем базу","g":"Present Perfect, Past Continuous, going to, сравнения, must / have to / should, вопросы и отрицания","v":"путешествия, здоровье, покупки, работа, учёба, технологии, чувства","s":"рассказывать истории, выражать мнение, описывать опыт, задавать вопросы","li":"короткие видео и подкасты A2 без постоянного перевода","r":"адаптированные книги и статьи A2","w":"письма, сообщения, истории, небольшие тексты"},{"l":"B1","name":"Свободное использование","g":"все основные времена, Perfect Continuous, Past Perfect, used to, условные 1-2 (3), пассив, косвенная речь, придаточные, модальные возможности, gerund / infinitive, question tags, связки, фразовые глаголы, словообразование","v":"образование, экология, технологии, соцсети, отношения, здоровье, преступность, культура, деньги, работа, наука, новости","s":"выражать и аргументировать мнение, соглашаться и спорить, сравнивать, говорить 2-5 минут на тему","li":"видео и подкасты B1 без субтитров или с английскими","r":"статьи, адаптированные и несложные оригинальные книги","w":"эссе, письма, истории, отзывы на 120-180 слов"},{"l":"B2","name":"Upper-Intermediate","g":"все времена без путаницы, все условные и смешанные, продвинутый пассив, causative, wish / if only, perfect modals, инверсия (основы), participle clauses, subjunctive, продвинутые предлоги и артикли, коллокации","v":"политика, экономика, психология, наука, климат, глобализация, медиа, реклама, ИИ, карьера, общество, право","s":"дебаты, длинные ответы, аргументация, перефразирование, спонтанная речь","li":"фильмы и сериалы, подкасты носителей","r":"оригинальные статьи и книги","w":"эссе «за и против», официальные письма, отчёты, отзывы, статьи"},{"l":"C1","name":"Advanced","g":"все времена на автомате, сложные условные, инверсия, cleft sentences, эмфаза, эллипсис, номинализация, hedging, продвинутые связки","v":"академический английский, бизнес, философия, медицина, литература, журналистика","s":"свободно говорить на абстрактные темы, быстро подбирать слова, идиомы и фразовые глаголы, тонкие оттенки мнения","li":"разные акценты, быстрая речь, сленг, юмор","r":"научные статьи, сложные новости, литература","w":"академические эссе, отчёты, аргументированные статьи, исследования"},{"l":"C2","name":"Proficiency","g":"контроль всех структур, тончайшие различия, естественное использование","v":"идиомы, сленг, редкая и профессиональная лексика, синонимы с оттенками, метафоры, игра слов","s":"почти как носитель: дискуссии, презентации, дебаты","li":"любой акцент, сарказм, скрытый смысл","r":"любые тексты, включая сложные официальные","w":"тексты любого стиля и сложности"}]};
